01. Static Website Hosting:
S3 can host static website content.

Example:

index.html
style.css
app.js
images/

Architecture:

User
 |
 v
CloudFront
 |
 v
S3
 |
 +-- index.html
 +-- CSS
 +-- JS

For production architectures, CloudFront + S3 is commonly used.




02. S3 + CloudFront:
Suppose your website contains:

index.html
app.js
style.css
logo.png

Instead of every user directly accessing S3:

Users
  |
  v
CloudFront
  |
  v
S3

CloudFront caches content closer to users.

This can improve latency and reduce repeated origin requests.




03. S3 Event Notifications:
S3 can trigger events when objects change.

For example:

User uploads image
       |
       v
      S3
       |
       v
 Event Notification
       |
       v
     Lambda

Example:

invoice.pdf uploaded
       ↓
S3
       ↓
Lambda
       ↓
Process invoice

Events can integrate with services such as:

Lambda
SQS
SNS
EventBridge
